        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xwaylár Ehudi a tí: (Inooín an múk urén oo gur'ér maraá baabi'ii'ín kudaá yaamuloouusér Geba. Ala inooín kiri loohatís ay Manahati.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na'amani nee Ahiya, nee Gera. Gera an kudá' muu gwaa loohatis. Inós Usa gway laqwaál nee Ahihudiwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaharaimu tlaawaywós kudá' tsár ta bay, Hushimu nee Ba'ara, gina diyaá/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós iwa baraá yaamaá Moabu i dirii'i Hodeshi gari duúx. Inós na/iiká' giri laqwál: Yoabu, nee Sibia, nee Mesha, nee Malkamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Yeusi, nee Sakia, nee Mirma. Na/iiwós kuká' sleémeero tari múk urén oo gur'ér maraá baabi'ii'ín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaharaimu nee hareerós tidá' ta bay Hushimu daaqaywí nguna laqwaaliyé': Ahitubu nee Elpa'ali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
