              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqoó Ulamu a miguuse baraá slaqwaraaro, a múk ga/aldaá koóm. Inós na/ii ngi kon ki ur, nee na/aá naangós a muu tsiiru nee mibeeri kooán. Mukwí sleémeero oo tlahhoó Benyamini.",
          "type": "text",
